{
  "_comment": [
    "DeckCase id -> the name the deck case is shown under in Master Duel.",
    "",
    "The ids come from the asset names",
    "(assets/resourcesassetbundle/images/deckcase/deckcase####). The NAMES are",
    "not in those assets -- a case carries an id and nothing readable.",
    "",
    "SOURCE: the DECK_CASE section of YgoMaster/Data/ItemID.json, which is",
    "generated from Master Duel's own client item data. A texture id ####",
    "corresponds to item id 108####. A local copy of that file is kept at",
    "MasterDuelDecomp/research/item-names/ItemID.json, and the mapping is",
    "documented in that project's vault under 'Asset Catalog/Deck Boxes'.",
    "",
    "DO NOT name a case after the monster in its art. DeckCase0034 was first",
    "taken for a Blue-Eyes case and is really Cyber Kaiser; DeckCase2002 was",
    "called a Dark Magician case and is really The Millennium Puzzle. Both",
    "mistakes are still carried as migrations in DeckBoxStyle.known().",
    "",
    "tools/import_deck_boxes.py refuses any id missing from this file."
  ],
